**Status: IMPLEMENTED → COMPILE_VERIFIED → HARNESS_TESTED → APK_OBSERVED** (evidence dir `docs/evidence/w12_childfm_vlc/` + fresh re-verify 2026-11-06 on base `7bbf087a` + C7-RA; not yet INTEGRATED — no push). APK: vlc_13070208.apk sha256 `727693d59c4d678c…`.

