+// arc SpriteBatch.createShader: gl_Position = u_projTrans * a_position;
+// frag = texture2D(u_texture0, uv) * v_color. Bloom composite (arc Bloom):
+// tex0 * OriginalIntensity + tex1 * BloomIntensity. The uniforms block
