Per combine cycle there are exactly **THREE `cnt=5123` glDrawElements** (serials 10,11,12 for att15; 20,21,22 for att16; repeating every 10 serials): #10 paints att black→WHITE, #11 UNCHANGED, #12 white→black. These are Mindustry's **batched color-blit draws** (`tex0 = 1×1 white pixel texture`, `blend=1`, `clear=0xff000000`) — the app's dark background blits.

**B. Decisive refinement (why dark blits land white)**
The pre rows dump the enabled-attrib table with the store delta and a decode AT the PGL-held raw pointer (what `get_v_attrib` actually reads):

```
