-    }
+    // ── F-C4-596 (W11, 4APP4 Coder-4) — the EXP-045 Intrinsics stub gate is
+    // REMOVED ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
+    // The gate stubbed three kotlin.jvm.internal.Intrinsics methods
